<body class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-6">
  <div class="privacy-card max-w-7xl w-full rounded-[42px] shadow-2xl shadow-slate-400/20 p-6 md:p-10 lg:p-12 transition-all">

    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mb-4">
      <div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight flex gap-3">
        <img src="https://cdn.cococe.rw/meta/fav.png" alt="COCOCE" class="h-16">
        <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Your data, your control.<br><span class="text-brand font-bold">What does it mean to us?</span>
        </h1>
      </div>
      <div class="ml-auto bg-[#d9e6f2] text-[#0b2b4a] text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#b7cde0] whitespace-nowrap">
        <i class="fas fa-lock mr-1"></i> Privacy & Authentication
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-base md:text-lg text-[#2d4b67] border-l-4 md:border-l-5 border-[#4a7fa7] pl-4 md:pl-5 mb-8 font-normal">
      Transparency about what we store, how we secure it, and what you should know before signing in.
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
    
      <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-6 border border-[#e2edf7] shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xl font-semibold text-brand border-b-2 border-brand pb-2.5 mb-4">
          <i class="fas fa-id-card text-brand text-2xl w-7 text-center"></i>
          What we store (minimal)
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-700">
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span><strong>Email address</strong> – used as your unique identifier and for critical security alerts.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span><strong>Password hash</strong> – we never store your plain password. Only a salted, slow hash.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span><strong>Account metadata</strong> – creation date, last sign-in, and basic device/browser info to detect anomalies.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span><strong>Display name (optional)</strong> – if you choose to provide it.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#2b4d6a] flex items-start gap-2">
          <i class="fas fa-info-circle mt-0.5 text-[#2a6496]"></i>
          We never ask for your full address, phone number, or payment details unless you explicitly enable paid features.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-6 border border-[#e2edf7] shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xl font-semibold text-brand border-b-2 border-brand pb-2.5 mb-4">
          <i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-brand text-2xl w-7 text-center"></i>
          How we keep it
        </div>
        <p class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <i class="fas fa-lock text-brand"></i> 
            <strong>Your credentials are encrypted and stored more securely.</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="bg-[#e2f0e9] rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 my-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-[#1e5a3a]">
          <i class="fas fa-user-secret text-xl"></i>
          <strong>“Even our team cannot access your data.”</strong>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 mt-3 text-slate-700">
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span>Passwords are hashed with <strong>Argon2id</strong> + unique salt.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span>All data is encrypted in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256).</span>
          </li>
          <li class="list-check">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-[#1d7a4b] text-lg"></i>
            <span>Zero‑knowledge architecture for authentication secrets.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-brand border-b-2 border-brand pb-2.5 mb-4">
        <i class="fas fa-cookie-bite text-brand text-2xl w-7 text-center"></i>
        Cookies & authentication
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 md:gap-10">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <p class="font-semibold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-cookie text-[#2a6496]"></i> What cookies do we use?</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 mb-3">
            <span class="cookie-item"><i class="fas fa-key text-[#b65f22]"></i> Session cookie (httpOnly, secure)</span>
            <span class="cookie-item"><i class="fas fa-chart-simple text-[#b65f22]"></i> CSRF protection token</span>
            <span class="cookie-item"><i class="fas fa-sliders text-[#b65f22]"></i> Preferences (e.g. dark mode)</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">We never use third‑party tracking cookies for authentication. Our cookies are strictly necessary to keep you signed in and protect against cross‑site request forgery.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <p class="font-semibold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-fingerprint text-[#2a6496]"></i> What authentication means for you</p>
          <p class="text-slate-700">Authentication verifies that you are who you claim to be. When you log in, COCOCE creates a temporary session — a short‑lived key that tells our servers it’s really you. That session expires after a set time of inactivity or when you sign out.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-[#fff8ee] rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-7 border border-[#ffd8b5] shadow-md shadow-amber-200/20">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#9b4a0e] mb-5">
        <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle text-2xl md:text-3xl text-[#b55a1a]"></i>
        ⚠️ Important session & security cautions
      </div>
      <ul class="space-y-4">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
          <i class="fas fa-clock text-[#b85e1c] text-xl mt-0.5 w-6 text-center"></i>
          <div><strong>Session lifetime:</strong> For your safety, sessions automatically expire after 30 minutes of inactivity. Always sign out manually when you’re done, especially on shared devices.</div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
          <i class="fas fa-user-lock text-[#b85e1c] text-xl mt-0.5 w-6 text-center"></i>
          <div><strong>Password sharing / protection:</strong> Never share your password — not with friends, not with support (we will never ask for it). Use a unique passphrase and a password manager.</div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
          <i class="fas fa-bug text-[#b85e1c] text-xl mt-0.5 w-6 text-center"></i>
          <div><strong>Browser data hijacks:</strong> Malicious extensions, cached credentials, or session tokens stored in your browser can be stolen if your device is compromised. Attackers may use your browser’s stored caches to enter or steal information.</div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
          <i class="fas fa-wifi text-[#b85e1c] text-xl mt-0.5 w-6 text-center"></i>
          <div><strong>Public networks & shared machines:</strong> Avoid signing in from public computers, libraries, or uncontrolled Wi‑Fi. If you must, use a trusted VPN and always sign out and clear browser data afterwards.</div>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="urgent-note mt-5">
        <i class="fas fa-shield-virus text-2xl text-[#c9621e]"></i>
        <span>Even if our system monitors your account security, login details, attacks may use your browser's stored caches to enter / stole information. We urge you to always sign out after using your account and avoid accessing / signing in from public uncontrollable machines or public networks.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 mt-4">
        <span class="badge-encrypt"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Always sign out</span>
        <span class="badge-encrypt"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Use private/incognito if needed</span>
        <span class="badge-encrypt"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Keep browser updated</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 bg-brand-light rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-6 border-l-6 border-brand flex items-center gap-4 shadow-sm">
      <i class="fas fa-database text-3xl md:text-4xl text-brand"></i>
      <div class="text-slate-800"><strong>Browser cache can betray you:</strong> Even with our strict encryption, if you save passwords in your browser or leave a session open, someone with access to your device could impersonate you. Always lock your device and use a screen lock.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 pt-5 border-t border-brand flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-3 text-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><img src="https://cdn.cococe.rw/meta/fav.png" alt="COCOCE" class="h-8"> <h1 class="text-brand text-lg font-extrabold">COCOCE &copy;</h1> · Your Wish Is Our Priority</div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="fas fa-envelope text-brand"></i> sales@cococe.rw</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

